S4 methods are defined with function setGeneric and setMethod. Conventionally, all setGeneric declarations could be moved into a single file in cases that there are multiple setMethod definitions in different file (for different signatures). There could be a file called "00-generics.R" to have all the setGenerics. The file naming scheme ensures that the file will be interpreted first when installing the package, so that the interpreter will not complain when it comes to any of the setMethods.
