Antonio Piccolboni <https://sparkr.atlassian.net/secure/ViewProfile.jspa?name=piccolbo> We recently improved our closure serialization to only capture what is required and it looks like that might have affected the way we handle package private functions.

One clarification: In otherpackage::function_name, is the otherpackage already loaded ? If you use the `includePackage` directive it should load the package on workers before executing the closures

